d States, Europe, and the Asia Pacific. The company provides GitLab, an intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps, which is a single application offering the entire software development lifecycle, including software, project plans, code, security scans, compliance checks, and deployment configurations. It also offers the GitLab Duo Agent Platform, which enables intelligent orchestration of teams and AI agents to execute tasks autonomously across planning, development, security, and deployment. This platform combines conversational AI assistance, purpose-built agents for specialized tasks, workflow automation, and enterprise controls. In addition, it offers related training and professional services. The company was formerly known as GitLab B.V. and changed its name to GitLab Inc. in July 2015. GitLab Inc. was founded in 2011 and is based in San Francisco, California.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"7372","sic_desc":"Services-Prepackaged Software","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","mcap":7805080064,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"SAN FRANCISCO, CA","exchange":"XNAS","fy_end":"0131","cik":1653482,"state_inc":"DE","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-06"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-10-06","q":[{"end":"2023-10-31","rev":149668000.0,"rev_yoy":32.5,"eps":-1.84,"eps_yoy":-457.6,"ni":-285158000.0,"ni_yoy":-488.5,"nm":-190.5,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-01-31","rev":163779000.0,"rev_yoy":33.3,"eps":-0.23,"eps_yoy":14.8,"ni":-36467000.0,"ni_yoy":5.9,"nm":-22.3,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2024-04-30","rev":169187000.0,"rev_yoy":33.3,"eps":-0.35,"eps_yoy":0.0,"ni":-55233000.0,"ni_yoy":-5.3,"nm":-32.6,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-07-31","rev":182584000.0,"rev_yoy":30.8,"eps":0.08,"eps_yoy":"turned +","ni":12